Copies of the LGPL/GPL license texts supplied by upstream are in that directory.
Built library names: libffmpegJNI.so, arm64-v8a and armeabi-v7a.
The Kotlin application loads this module dynamically through the Media3 bridge.

Launcher icon: artwork supplied by the user as
青色电视与简约卫星天线.png, copied byte-for-byte into the application.
The TV banner uses the same artwork, proportionally resized and composited
at the center of a light blue background without text; no AI redrawing is used.
These graphics are separate from the Apache-licensed application code.
Source hashes, dimensions and composition details are recorded in
branding/provenance.json. The composition script is
scripts/make-branding.py.
